Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和我不一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那漂亮又柔順的長髮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來閃閃發亮…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我美麗的黑羽鳥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然特地來到這種地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我親愛的白羽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那光澤動人的嘴唇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,還有那柔美的指尖！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,以及
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,比夜色還要美麗的黑髮！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,為了見你一面特地遠道而來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,實在太值得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,您還是那麼會說話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙是誰啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那位是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雅納戈的市長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,市長？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那他來這裡幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他是薇洛妮卡大人的金…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我們店裡的大客戶堅持一定要見您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,還特地用假期跑來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,比起那個… 我聽說了喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,身為夜之女王的你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在學人當冒險者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,夜之…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,女王？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要做那麼危險的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果缺錢的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您的關心 市長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不過來我店裡休息的客人之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也有很多冒險者…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,為了能更深地撫慰他們 我太渴求能帶來更多慰藉的「某樣東西」…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就不知不覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把腳步走向了冒險…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,女…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,女神啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你實在太溫柔了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,噢噢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡你的溫柔都滲到我的五臟六腑裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第10話 剪髮與選擇）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在雅納戈等你喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,塔妮婭也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,您還會在這個村子待多久呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這個呢… 待太久也不太好…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟衝著我來的客人也很多吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不過沒有問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被您拯救的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,包含我在內 在店裡有很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,店由我們來打理就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,您想怎麼做都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你是嫌我礙事想趕我走吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,其… 其實我希望您能回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,騙你的啦 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,亮晶晶的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那大叔出手真闊綽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想要的話我可以給你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎麼做才能像姊姊一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把男人玩弄在掌心呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你也變得跟我一樣是個好女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露也能做到喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露也要當好女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那就先從像我一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把頭髮留長開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露的髮色很漂亮 剪短太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,頭髮可是女人的命
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的頭髮是好女人的必備條件
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可是莉露是冒險者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要方便活動才好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,冒險者哪有空天天顧頭髮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是嫌麻煩而已吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,頭髮變長了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在變得更難看之前我幫你剪掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,現在？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你反正也很閒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要剪什麼髮型呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我還沒回答你咧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,照老樣子就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我會認真剪 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很熟練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露也來幫忙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,給我乖乖待著！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘖…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露明明也會剪得很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,想想 我們也認識很久了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到你竟然會升到白銀等級
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,夜之女王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊 總有一天要成為
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很適合亮晶晶長髮的夜之女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就要變成超強冒險者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都吃到飽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,話說你連市長都能玩弄在掌心…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到我還追到這種地方來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你待太久了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你亂動會刺到喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不是已經刺到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,結束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,剪好了 始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我去散個步好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露也要來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露要在這裡等始！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,工具就讓莉露幫你收起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是幫大忙了 那就拜託你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,路上小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露也能把始變得很帥的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,被您拯救的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,包含我在內 在店裡有很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想繼續當冒險者的話 頭髮也太長了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好！既然決定了就趕快收拾回程吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這可怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 各位大叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,倉庫裡跑出蜘蛛了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛而已 有什麼好大驚小怪的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我去幫你們除掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是蜘蛛沒錯但…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,請問東雲先生在嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,始在睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,安靜一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可是事態緊急
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我醒著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,東雲先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡小姐被蜘蛛抓走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,換… 換造型嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,東雲先生被剃得光溜溜的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 始… 噗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我嚇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什麼啊 到底哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,難怪覺得頭特別輕…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她… 她說要去散步…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,大鷹跳蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到獵物之後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有會先放著不管 等獵物虛弱的習性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是從這個洞鑽進來的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是薇洛妮卡大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只要沒有受重傷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想應該沒問題…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪我沉迷於製作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,「被揍很爽的魔物排行榜」…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思啊 始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我們光是逃命就已經拼盡全力…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 這本來就是冒險者的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,始先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡大人就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,救回來之後我還要揍她一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事嗎 莉露
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,巢的擴張範圍還真大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,連蚯蚓鼴鼠都不想靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,得小心別被牠們撞飛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡分兩路搜索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊交給你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那個蠢貨到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,連鹿都被當成食物嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然連這麼大的生物也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊沒事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,唉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在的話給我回一聲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找到你我要宰了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你那麼大聲會把魔獸引來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,失策失策
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 先這樣把蜘蛛減少的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那蠢貨多少也會安全點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是始！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就算沒頭髮 始還是始！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,蚯蚓鼴鼠！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,始！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,別管我！去找薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,交給我吧 始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露一定會找到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不在嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才那個聲音是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,聲音是從這邊傳來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露 你來救我了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一起回去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以過來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我回不去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經… 動不了了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我們會想辦法的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛 別拉我啦 莉露
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你受傷了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊由莉露來保護！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,頭髮是女人的命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的頭髮是好女人的必備條件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我美麗的黑羽鳥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大姊姊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:18:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,關鍵時刻就這麼不可靠…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,誰說我不可靠？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你這腦袋是怎麼回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想怎樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是你搞的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我有好好幫你剪啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那個… 莉露覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,始這樣也很帥…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我以為可以剪得更帥…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,光頭也很適合你喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要笑到什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,短髮也很適合您
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,始啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-小心腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-就算光溜溜也很帥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露是這麼覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本沒在反省吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有反省…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我不吃晚餐也可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那種事誰管你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她的頭髮真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能像那樣漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能那樣閃閃發亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能像她那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,笑得那麼幸福嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我把莉露的頭髮送你當賠禮…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就說不要了！真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,龍也願意為始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,分點毛給你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,別了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,當椅子的那位也可以分頭髮給始嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能讓薇洛妮卡大人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,替我剃髮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常樂意！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,莉露
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你很會剃頭髮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我頭髮也變短了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那我暫時也在這邊當冒險者吧 請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,滾回去啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（下回 魅惑的力量）
